(footprint "SW_MX_HotSwap_PTH_double_ISOEnter_MXPCBStab" (version 20221018) (generator pcbnew)
  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Cherry MX style mechanical keyboard switch, through-hole soldering and Kailh/Gateron hot-swap socket, the hole of the socket is plated, double-sided mounting. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.2=14.00mm square with R0.60 corner relief (center inset 0.35) (MX / MX Low Profile / Gateron Low Profile). Keycap: ISO Enter (courtyard). Cherry MX PCB-mount stabilizer holes included (vertical 2u, wire side at x=-8.255). Stabilizer plate cut on User.5 (fits plate-mount and PCB-mount MX stabilizers).")
